    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/913fcfef3ca2be693157800378aa759b.poster.avif?t=1751146437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/913fcfef3ca2be693157800378aa759b.webm?t=1751146437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/913fcfef3ca2be693157800378aa759b.mp4?t=1751146437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deer awakens in a peaceful forest, but something is deeply wrong. As he leaps through a fractured world where nature and machines collide, he must uncover the truth behind his mysterious surroundings, and himself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stalhart is a cinematic puzzle-platformer \u2014 a moving tale of instinct and courage. It is the debut title from <i>Para</i>, a two-person team driven by a love for storytelling and nature.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/e9a9a2ddbb10667ba46756ec87de9ac7.poster.avif?t=1751146437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/e9a9a2ddbb10667ba46756ec87de9ac7.webm?t=1751146437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/e9a9a2ddbb10667ba46756ec87de9ac7.mp4?t=1751146437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY AS A DEER.\u00a0</strong>Leap with agility across danger, smash through obstacles with your antlers, and sprint through a mysterious, reactive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAUNTINGLY BEAUTIFUL WORLD.\u00a0</strong>Explore a stylized landscape where whimsical nature collides with cold, menacing machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC PERSPECTIVES.\u00a0</strong>Shift seamlessly between side-scrolling platforming and fast-paced runner sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUZZLES WITH PURPOSE.\u00a0</strong>Solve challenges that demand observation, timing, and creative thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEALTH AND SURVIVAL.\u00a0</strong>Outsmart menacing mechanical enemies using stealth, speed, and sharp instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORDLESS STORYTELLING.\u00a0</strong>Experience a carefully paced blend of action and emotion in a wordless tale of identity, instinct, and courage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/84c44c32e41c96bc6643a26ae62c4d8d.poster.avif?t=1751146437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/84c44c32e41c96bc6643a26ae62c4d8d.webm?t=1751146437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/84c44c32e41c96bc6643a26ae62c4d8d.mp4?t=1751146437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/913fcfef3ca2be693157800378aa759b.poster.avif?t=1751146437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/913fcfef3ca2be693157800378aa759b.webm?t=1751146437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/913fcfef3ca2be693157800378aa759b.mp4?t=1751146437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deer awakens in a peaceful forest, but something is deeply wrong. As he leaps through a fractured world where nature and machines collide, he must uncover the truth behind his mysterious surroundings, and himself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stalhart is a cinematic puzzle-platformer \u2014 a moving tale of instinct and courage. It is the debut title from <i>Para</i>, a two-person team driven by a love for storytelling and nature.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/e9a9a2ddbb10667ba46756ec87de9ac7.poster.avif?t=1751146437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/e9a9a2ddbb10667ba46756ec87de9ac7.webm?t=1751146437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/e9a9a2ddbb10667ba46756ec87de9ac7.mp4?t=1751146437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY AS A DEER.\u00a0</strong>Leap with agility across danger, smash through obstacles with your antlers, and sprint through a mysterious, reactive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAUNTINGLY BEAUTIFUL WORLD.\u00a0</strong>Explore a stylized landscape where whimsical nature collides with cold, menacing machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC PERSPECTIVES.\u00a0</strong>Shift seamlessly between side-scrolling platforming and fast-paced runner sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUZZLES WITH PURPOSE.\u00a0</strong>Solve challenges that demand observation, timing, and creative thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEALTH AND SURVIVAL.\u00a0</strong>Outsmart menacing mechanical enemies using stealth, speed, and sharp instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORDLESS STORYTELLING.\u00a0</strong>Experience a carefully paced blend of action and emotion in a wordless tale of identity, instinct, and courage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/84c44c32e41c96bc6643a26ae62c4d8d.poster.avif?t=1751146437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/84c44c32e41c96bc6643a26ae62c4d8d.webm?t=1751146437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256510/extras/84c44c32e41c96bc6643a26ae62c4d8d.mp4?t=1751146437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
